{"title":"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For a certain complex number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />, the polynomial\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/8/07858e6ad5c6c6f79e5c145fe6e55e5cee64606e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[P(x) = (x^2 - 2x + 2)(x^2 - cx + 4)(x^2 - 4x + 8)\\]\" width=\"374\" height=\"19\" />has exactly 4 distinct roots. What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/7/ee71b080efbd8d38394b4e41eeb0b02b750ecfed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|c|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/2/2124ceece736cfba437582756f22b84eca68d496.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } 2 \\qquad \\textbf{(B) } \\sqrt{6} \\qquad \\textbf{(C) } 2\\sqrt{2} \\qquad \\textbf{(D) } 3 \\qquad \\textbf{(E) } \\sqrt{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"417\" height=\"21\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The polynomial can be factored further broken down into\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/6/5c699aaebd44347c7bbcd4487c7a83adac5cfb21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(x) = (x - [1 - i])(x - [1 + i])(x - [2 - 2i])(x - [2 + 2i])(x^2 - cx + 4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"561\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>by using the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Quadratic_formula\" title=\"Quadratic formula\">quadratic formula</a> on each of the quadratic factors. Since the first four roots are all distinct, the term <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/5/f85cd9272ddc9936c2ad6e154ba173918b5bd0b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x^2 - cx + 4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"102\" height=\"19\" /> must be a product of any combination of two (not necessarily distinct) factors from the set: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/2/f22162fa0a2e41e73b5ea80719408d8f5ecd9535.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x - [1 - i]), (x - [1 + i]), (x - [2 - 2i]),$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"312\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/1/e51477ed120dfc37e1a7449a26b34b662503c537.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x - [2 + 2i])$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"102\" height=\"18\" />. We need the two factors to yield a constant term of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> when multiplied together. The only combinations that work are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/5/0a56acd71bbc5cc4f1df5e2c28d794b5de4bca82.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x - [1 - i])$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"93\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/1/e51477ed120dfc37e1a7449a26b34b662503c537.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x - [2 + 2i])$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"102\" height=\"18\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/e/ace596aab495a876b2c5bfc8e9673d094e3292f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x - [1+i])$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"96\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/d/8ddb804ea20abbba4aa7a2b276616fafeaf31d2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x - [2-2i])$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"102\" height=\"18\" />. When multiplied together, the polynomial is either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/0/7f07038ca07aad913679c4d0920aa39f31ee6247.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x^2 + [-3 + i]x + 4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"156\" height=\"20\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/d/6ad26b8c16cb83978041d57f12ef16b7d8a611dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x^2+[-3-i]x+4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"156\" height=\"20\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/d/95d25896da3417f497283bee36b121d1128a3a8b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = 3 \\pm i$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"69\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/c/d7cacb8f47339aadbfa496291b74ac9c4747c0ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|c| = \\boxed{\\textbf{(E) } \\sqrt{10}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"121\" height=\"33\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A\">2019 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_9\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_10\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_11\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_16\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_18\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_20\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_24\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_12_Problems_and_Solutions\"